{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52240","headline":"诗（幷序） 一 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥看世间人，村坊安社邑。\n一家有死生，合村相就泣。\n张口哭他屍，不知身去急。\n本是长眠鬼，蹔来地上立。\n欲似养儿毡，回乾且就湿。\n前死深埋却，後死续即人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}